lt=\"Release\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth?logo=github\u0026amp;label=release\u0026amp;color=blue\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/actions/workflows/ci.yml\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://github.com/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/actions/workflows/ci.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"CI\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://github.com/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/actions/workflows/security.yml\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://github.com/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/actions/workflows/security.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"Security\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://scorecard.dev/viewer/?uri=github.com/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/40ca50a51ed338dac2d3ad0184ebf964d4bebde2f8a1555252a8a29638a0c646/68747470733a2f2f6170692e73636f7265636172642e6465762f70726f6a656374732f6769746875622e636f6d2f6d61696e7461696e6572642f6d61696e7461696e6572642d617574682f6261646765\" alt=\"OpenSSF Scorecard\" data-canonical-src=\"https://api.scorecard.dev/projects/github.com/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/badge\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://www.bestpractices.dev/projects/14034\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/94a6aefda6db273b69e6ccd038997024340ab7c1eceef5a8a3f014c38cfa96f0/68747470733a2f2f7777772e626573747072616374696365732e6465762f70726f6a656374732f31343033342f626173656c696e65\" alt=\"OpenSSF Baseline\" data-canonical-src=\"https://www.bestpractices.dev/projects/14034/baseline\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://codecov.io/gh/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/230e8f9b837a217bd8473c55de2cb567e8f5bd8eaa4d14e8b56391d661fc5e98/68747470733a2f2f636f6465636f762e696f2f67682f6d61696e7461696e6572642f6d61696e7461696e6572642d617574682f67726170682f62616467652e737667\" alt=\"Coverage\" data-canonical-src=\"https://codecov.io/gh/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/graph/badge.svg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/blob/main/LICENSE\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/35b94db23d3ed026343335f74d52ce31e74b77ad7dab4e4b89f49f2026e0937f/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f6c6963656e73652d4170616368652d2d322e302d626c7565\" alt=\"License\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-Apache--2.0-blue\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003emaintainerd-auth\u003c/strong\u003e is an open-source, self-hostable identity and access platform — a single container that delivers authentication, federation, and fine-grained authorization for your applications, services, and APIs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eIt ships as \u003cstrong\u003eone all-in-one image\u003c/strong\u003e: the Go backend plus the admin console and hosted login UI, compiled into a single binary (no nginx, no sidecars). Bring your own PostgreSQL and Redis, and you have a full OAuth 2.0 / OpenID Connect provider and identity broker.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/25092979/633700964-476b3a33-ef0e-422c-8240-835ed94d9317.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..9i4WDvlkrHaT4_lLQW3QbV8SCFG3izpPt9RMcBpvzW0\"\u003e\u003cimg width=\"1914\" height=\"1010\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2026-08-10 19-45-55\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/25092979/633700964-476b3a33-ef0e-422c-8240-835ed94d9317.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..9i4WDvlkrHaT4_lLQW3QbV8SCFG3izpPt9RMcBpvzW0\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1010px;; aspect-ratio: 1914 / 1010; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eFeatures\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-features\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Features\" href=\"#features\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cul dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFull OAuth 2.0 + OIDC\u003c/strong\u003e — authorization code (PKCE), client credentials, device, token exchange, PAR, CIBA, dynamic client registration, and DPoP\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJWT (RS256)\u003c/strong\u003e with multi-key JWKS and automatic key rotation\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-factor authentication\u003c/strong\u003e — TOTP, WebAuthn/passkeys, SMS OTP, backup codes, and step-up auth\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFederation\u003c/strong\u003e — broker sign-in over \u003cstrong\u003eOIDC, OAuth 2.0, and SAML 2.0\u003c/strong\u003e: Google, Microsoft, GitHub, GitLab, LinkedIn, Facebook, X (Twitter), Auth0, Cognito, any standards-compliant IdP, and maintainerd-to-maintainerd. Includes JIT provisioning, identity linking, and home-realm discovery\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFine-grained access control\u003c/strong\u003e — RBAC with granular permissions, plus IAM services, APIs, policies, service-token policy bundles, and service-to-service authorization\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-tenant\u003c/strong\u003e — full tenant isolation, per-tenant configuration, and invite flows\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSession management\u003c/strong\u003e — refresh-token rotation, family revocation, reuse detection, and concurrent-session limits\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWebhook delivery\u003c/strong\u003e — auth-event notifications signed with HMAC-SHA256, with replay protection\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAudit logging\u003c/strong\u003e — structured auth events with retention, per-tenant isolation, and PII redaction\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePluggable secret management\u003c/strong\u003e — env vars, AWS Secrets Manager / SSM, HashiCorp Vault, Azure Key Vault, GCP Secret Manager, or mounted files\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEmail delivery over SMTP\u003c/strong\u003e — configured per tenant; works with any relay (SES, SendGrid, Mailgun, Postmark, Resend, or your own server all speak SMTP)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOpenTelemetry\u003c/strong\u003e — traces, metrics, and a Prometheus endpoint\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eQuick Start\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-quick-start\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Quick Start\" href=\"#quick-start\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eRun the released image locally behind nginx — clean HTTPS hostnames, \u003cstrong\u003eno ports\u003c/strong\u003e — with PostgreSQL + Redis. For local testing; in production you front it with your own TLS.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e1. Download these four files\u003c/strong\u003e into one empty folder:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/main/examples/quickstart/docker-compose.yml\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003edocker-compose.yml\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e · \u003ca href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/main/examples/quickstart/.env.example\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003e.env.example\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e · \u003ca href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/main/examples/quickstart/nginx.conf\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003enginx.conf\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e · \u003ca href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/main/examples/quickstart/setup.sh\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003e\u003ccode\u003esetup.sh\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2. Run:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"cp .env.example .env\nchmod +x setup.sh \u0026amp;\u0026amp; ./setup.sh          # generates your keys + a local TLS cert\n\nsudo tee -a /etc/hosts \u0026gt;/dev/null \u0026lt;\u0026lt;'EOF'\n127.0.0.1 console.auth.maintainerd.local identity.auth.maintainerd.local console-api.auth.maintainerd.local identity-api.auth.maintainerd.local\nEOF\n\ndocker compose up -d\"\u003e\u003cpre\u003ecp .env.example .env\nchmod +x setup.sh \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e\u0026amp;\u0026amp;\u003c/span\u003e ./setup.sh          \u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e#\u003c/span\u003e generates your keys + a local TLS cert\u003c/span\u003e\n\nsudo tee -a /etc/hosts \u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e\u0026gt;\u003c/span\u003e/dev/null \u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003e\u0026lt;\u0026lt;\u003c/span\u003e'\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003eEOF\u003c/span\u003e'\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e127.0.0.1 console.auth.maintainerd.local identity.auth.maintainerd.local console-api.auth.maintainerd.local identity-api.auth.maintainerd.local\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-s\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-k\"\u003eEOF\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\n\ndocker compose up -d\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3. Open the setup wizard 👉 \u003ca href=\"https://console.auth.maintainerd.local/setup/tenant\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://console.auth.maintainerd.local/setup/tenant\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e and create your first \u003cstrong\u003etenant\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eadmin\u003c/strong\u003e (accept the one-time self-signed-cert warning).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cmarkdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eURL\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSetup wizard — \u003cstrong\u003estart here\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://console.auth.maintainerd.local/setup/tenant\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://console.auth.maintainerd.local/setup/tenant\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAdmin console\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://console.auth.maintainerd.local\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://console.auth.maintainerd.local\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHosted login (end users)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://identity.auth.maintainerd.local\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://identity.auth.maintainerd.local\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOIDC discovery\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://identity-api.auth.maintainerd.local/.well-known/openid-configuration\" rel=\"nofollow\"\u003ehttps://identity-api.auth.maintainerd.local/.well-known/openid-configuration\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/markdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eThis is a \u003cstrong\u003elocal\u003c/strong\u003e setup for trying it out. In production, front it with your own TLS + real hostnames, keep \u003ccode\u003eAPP_ENV=production\u003c/code\u003e and \u003ccode\u003eDB_SSLMODE=require\u003c/code\u003e, and source secrets from a manager. See \u003ca href=\"/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/blob/main/docs/contributing/environment-variables.md\"\u003eEnvironment Variables\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003ePorts\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-ports\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Ports\" href=\"#ports\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eThe image serves each surface on its own port so browser origins stay isolated and auth cookies are host-only.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cmarkdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003ePort\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eSurface\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eExpose publicly?\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003e3000\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eAdmin console SPA\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes — operators\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003e3001\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eHosted login / identity SPA\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes — end users\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003e8081\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eData plane — OAuth2/OIDC issuer + public API\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eYes — where the issuer must resolve\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003e8080\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eControl plane — management API\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo\u003c/strong\u003e — keep internal (the console reaches it in-process)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ccode\u003e8082\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eManagement — health checks + Prometheus \u003ccode\u003e/metrics\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNo\u003c/strong\u003e — keep internal\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/markdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eDocumentation\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-documentation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Documentation\" href=\"#documentation\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cmarkdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\n\u003cthead\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eDocument\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003cth\u003e\u003c/th\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/thead\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/blob/main/docs/features.md\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eThe feature map — each links to its implementation doc (flow, files, config, security)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/blob/main/docs/overview.md\"\u003eSystem Overview\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eConceptual model: tenants, clients, identities, the two-plane architecture\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/blob/main/docs/contributing/environment-variables.md\"\u003eEnvironment Variables\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eEvery configuration variable, with defaults\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/blob/main/docs/operations/operator-runbook.md\"\u003eOperator Runbook\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eInstall, first-run bootstrap, backups, and upgrades\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/blob/main/docs/contributing/architecture.md\"\u003eArchitecture\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSystem design, code layout, and data flow\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/blob/main/docs/openapi.yaml\"\u003eAPI Reference\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eOpenAPI 3.1 spec (also served at \u003ccode\u003e/openapi.json\u003c/code\u003e)\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e\u003ca href=\"/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/blob/main/docs/contributing/getting-started.md\"\u003eGetting Started (contributors)\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eLocal development environment\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/markdown-accessiblity-table\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eBuilding from source\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-building-from-source\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Building from source\" href=\"#building-from-source\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eYou only need this for development — the released image is the supported way to run maintainerd-auth.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"git clone https://github.com/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth.git\ncd maintainerd-auth\n\ngo test ./...                       # run the test suite\ngo build -tags embedassets ./cmd/server   # build the all-in-one binary (embeds the SPAs)\"\u003e\u003cpre\u003egit clone https://github.com/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth.git\n\u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003ecd\u003c/span\u003e maintainerd-auth\n\ngo \u003cspan class=\"pl-c1\"\u003etest\u003c/span\u003e ./...                       \u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e#\u003c/span\u003e run the test suite\u003c/span\u003e\ngo build -tags embedassets ./cmd/server   \u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"pl-c\"\u003e#\u003c/span\u003e build the all-in-one binary (embeds the SPAs)\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eThe two SPAs live under \u003ccode\u003eweb/console\u003c/code\u003e and \u003ccode\u003eweb/identity\u003c/code\u003e and are compiled into the binary via \u003ccode\u003ego:embed\u003c/code\u003e under the \u003ccode\u003eembedassets\u003c/code\u003e build tag.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eContributing\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-contributing\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Contributing\" href=\"#contributing\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eContributions are welcome. Please read \u003ca href=\"/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md\"\u003eCONTRIBUTING.md\u003c/a\u003e and the \u003ca href=\"/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/blob/main/docs/contributing/getting-started.md\"\u003egetting-started guide\u003c/a\u003e before opening a pull request.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003ch2 tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\"\u003eLicense\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ca id=\"user-content-license\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: License\" href=\"#license\"\u003e\u003csvg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cpath d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"\u003e\u003c/path\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eCopyright 2026 Reyco Seguma.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eLicensed under the Apache License 2.0. See \u003ca href=\"/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/blob/main/LICENSE\"\u003eLICENSE\u003c/a\u003e for the license terms and \u003ca href=\"/maintainerd/maintainerd-auth/blob/main/NOTICE\"\u003eNOTICE\u003c/a\u003e for attribution.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003chr\u003e\n\u003cp align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n  \u003cem\u003eBuilt by \u003ca href=\"https://github.com/xreyc\"\u003eReyco Seguma (@xreyc)\u003c/a\u003e and the Maintainerd community.\u003c/em\u003e\n\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/article\u003e","richTextTruncated":false,"renderedFileInfo":null,"symbols":{"timed_out":false,"not_analyzed":false,"symbols":[{"name":"Features","fully_qualified_name":"Features","kind":"section_2","ident_start":1894,"ident_end":1902,"extent_start":1891,"extent_end":3474,"ident_utf16":{"start":{"line_number":24,"utf16_col":3},"end":{"line_number":24,"utf16_col":11}},"extent_utf16":{"start":{"line_number":24,"utf16_col":0},"end":{"line_number":41,"utf16_col":0}}},{"name":"Quick Start","fully_qualified_name":"Quick Start","kind":"section_2","ident_start":3477,"ident_end":3488,"extent_start":3474,"extent_end":5348,"ident_utf16":{"start":{"line_number":41,"utf16_col":3},"end":{"line_numbe